theory.intro:
A timeline shows events in order along a line, drawn to scale so equal time gaps are equal distances.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.9]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(7.8,0);
\foreach \x/\lab in {0/t,1.8/{t+s},3.6/{t+2s},5.4/{t+3s},7.2/{t+4s}} {\draw (\x,-0.15)--(\x,0.15); \node[below,font=\small] at (\x,-0.15) {$\lab$};}
\fill (2.7,0) circle (2.5pt); \node[above,font=\small] at (2.7,0.15) {Event};
\node[above] at (3.6,0.9) {Equal spaces, equal time};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

